                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well.. where do I start?\n\nThe game has no real graphics and sound options, most maps won't even load up and just get stuck in the loading screen.\nGraphics are heavily outdated, no tutorial at all and a ugly UI on top of that.\n\nThe developer seems to be a racist and quite aggressive as well towards users, who leave a negative review or ask stuff in the forums and just bans left and right.\n\nOh and btw; Seems like he's selling the same game twice, just with a different name.\nhttp://store.steampowered.com/app/517500/Tactics_Bludgeons_Blessing/\n\nStay away from it.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1517252647,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1517252647,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 86,
                        "votes_funny": 6,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.8271430730819702,
                        "comment_count": 59,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Were you locked up in cell of my concentration camp? But there are no locks! I fired the guards long ago in 1945.\nSince then, it has been operating as a museum! Just knock on the door and ask the tourists to move the closet away from the door... \nWhat? Are there no tourists there?\nMaybe it's a psychiatric hospital? Wait for the doctor to come in and ask him about your diagnosis. Together we will try to solve your problem.\nI have internet. I can google pills for you for your illness.\nBy the way, you did a great job with photoshop. Your photo is not so disgusting now. But you have to work harder.",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1659278928,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": true
                    }
                ],
